{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o007b","title":"何进召董卓并遇害","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o007b-account","label":"正文","text":"何进、袁绍谋诛宦官，太后不从；何进召董卓欲胁太后，董卓未至何进已被杀。","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o004a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"何进袁绍谋诛宦官不获何后允乃召董卓上书胁后","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o004a-q"]},{"id":"rensu-a-a2a10996fc035139d6d9","label":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","text":"何进将诛黄门欲召董卓为助，郑泰谏以董卓强忍寡义、诚不待卓以为资援，又陈时之要务，进不能用","evidence":["rensu-q-ec413709301b2ab7a3a6"]},{"id":"rensu-a-98f4c4bd5fe9ba35d51a","label":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","text":"何进寻见害","evidence":["rensu-q-fb2143a5a0d18b851ec9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0051","role":"谋诛宦官并遇害","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"参与谋议","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0050","role":"不允","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0053","role":"被召","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0067","role":"进谏者","evidence":["rensu-q-ec413709301b2ab7a3a6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"中平六年","year":189,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o007b-q","wudi-q-o008","wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855"],"chronology":"wudi-y189","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o008","basis":"中平六年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,61,"O007b"],"order":39}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0050","name":"何太后","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0051","name":"何进","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0053","name":"董卓","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0067","name":"郑泰","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-84c2342f9d49bfb5684b","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝崩，少帝即位。大将军何进与司隶校尉袁绍，谋诛诸阉官，太后不从。进乃召卓，使将兵诣京师；并密令上书曰：“中常侍张让等窃幸乘宠〖1〗，浊乱海内。昔赵鞅兴晋阳之甲〖2〗，以逐君侧之恶。臣辄鸣钟鼓如洛阳〖3〗，即讨让等。”欲以胁迫太后。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-ec413709301b2ab7a3a6","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c172c36c6f19e1d68402","layer":"pei","quote":"进将诛黄门，欲召董卓为助，泰谓进曰：‘董卓强忍寡义，志欲无餍；若借之朝政，授之大事，将肆其心以危朝廷。以明公之威德，据阿衡之重任，秉意独断，诛除有罪，诚不待卓以为资援也！且事留变生，其鉴不远。’又为陈时之要务，进不能用","attribution":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-011440cf6742ee5cb197","start":101,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-fb2143a5a0d18b851ec9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c172c36c6f19e1d68402","layer":"pei","quote":"进寻见害","attribution":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-011440cf6742ee5cb197","start":233,"end":237,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-50b64ee18ec5610ba8a9","layer":"original","quote":"大将军何进与袁绍谋诛宦官〖5〗，太后不听；进乃召董卓〖6〗，欲以胁太后。﹝一﹞卓未至而进见杀。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
